/Title (Neltah Tshepiso Mokgware-Monosi is the Founder and Managing Director of Tempest Gold \(with over 10 years of experience\), a real estate company with business interests in Africa. She holds a BA in Economics and Accounting, an MSc in Project Management from the University of Bolton, and a Doctorate in Real Estate from the University of Witwatersrand. Neltah also has qualifications in real estate, business administration, and vocational and education training \(CVET\).)
